<title>USA: McKesson says 2.8 mln of its shares sold.</title>
<headline>McKesson says 2.8 mln of its shares sold.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>McKesson Corp said Wednesday that about 2.8 million of its common shares were sold by Kelso Investment Associates IV LP and other investors in an overnight underwritten offering.</p>
<p>The company said Morgan Stanley &amp; Co was underwriter.</p>
<p>McKesson said it had issued about 2.8 million shares in February as part of its acquisition of General Medical Inc.</p>
